    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rise. Fight. Conquer.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Last Wave</i>, you step into the shoes of Ren who is trapped in an unforgiving world where survival is the only goal. Face relentless waves of enemies, each round pushing your skills to the limit. Strategically combine melee combat, magic, and powerful techniques to outlast the ever-growing threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wave-Based Combat</strong> \u2013 Battle against increasingly difficult enemies. Stay sharp, adapt your strategy, and prepare for the next round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Your Weapon</strong> \u2013 Choose between the <strong>swift and deadly sword</strong> or the <strong>versatile and mystical staff</strong>. Each weapon has its own specialties, techniques, and playstyle. Will you strike with precision or unleash powerful elemental magic?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental Abilities &amp; Techniques</strong> \u2013 Unlock and wield <strong>fire, ice, and lightning</strong> magic to devastate enemies. Combine these powers with melee attacks for explosive combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive World</strong> \u2013 Fight through hostile environments filled with deadly creatures, each with their own behaviors and attack patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to survive?<br><br>We\u2019re not done yet. <i>Last Wave</i> will continue to grow with future updates. Expect new gameplay mechanics, weapons, and environments to test your survival skills.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rise. Fight. Conquer.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Last Wave</i>, you step into the shoes of Ren who is trapped in an unforgiving world where survival is the only goal. Face relentless waves of enemies, each round pushing your skills to the limit. Strategically combine melee combat, magic, and powerful techniques to outlast the ever-growing threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wave-Based Combat</strong> \u2013 Battle against increasingly difficult enemies. Stay sharp, adapt your strategy, and prepare for the next round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Your Weapon</strong> \u2013 Choose between the <strong>swift and deadly sword</strong> or the <strong>versatile and mystical staff</strong>. Each weapon has its own specialties, techniques, and playstyle. Will you strike with precision or unleash powerful elemental magic?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental Abilities &amp; Techniques</strong> \u2013 Unlock and wield <strong>fire, ice, and lightning</strong> magic to devastate enemies. Combine these powers with melee attacks for explosive combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive World</strong> \u2013 Fight through hostile environments filled with deadly creatures, each with their own behaviors and attack patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to survive?<br><br>We\u2019re not done yet. <i>Last Wave</i> will continue to grow with future updates. Expect new gameplay mechanics, weapons, and environments to test your survival skills.</p>",
    "short_description": "A survival action RPG with fast-paced combat and strategic decision-making. Fight waves of enemies using combos, elemental spells, and techniques. Master the command system to unleash devastating attacks and achieve high scores. Inspired by 5th-gen low-poly visuals with modern action RPG gameplay.",
